      "text": "public abstract sealed class Livraison permits LivraisonStandard, LivraisonExpress {\n    protected double poidsKg;\n    protected Livraison(double poidsKg) {\n        this.poidsKg = poidsKg;\n    }\n\n    public abstract double calculerFrais();\n}",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 6,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "public abstract sealed class Livraison permits LivraisonStandard, LivraisonExpress {\n    protected double poidsKg;\n    protected Livraison(double poidsKg) {\n        this.poidsKg = poidsKg;\n    }\n\n    public abstract double calculerFrais();\n}",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "I2CK9qehXHlVGxhw1-91m",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1314.3802861737113,
